                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.00/1855: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-11T12:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received April 12—2:40
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>38. Louis Borno elected President by Council of State last night at 7:20. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
